{"title": "Heat Metal: Reapply Damage (Condition)", "pageid": 40116, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heat_Metal:_Reapply_Damage_(Condition)", "categories": ["Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0c/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Heat Metal Reapply Damage Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0c/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/0c/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Heat Metal: Reapply Damage</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p>Creature can reapply the damage dealt by the heated metal. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">HEAT_METAL_REAPPLY</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHEAT_METAL_REAPPLY%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CHEAT_METAL_REAPPLY%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal:_Reapply_Damage\" title=\"Heat Metal: Reapply Damage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/60px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/80px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reapply Heat Metal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/40px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Metal:_Reapply_Damage\" title=\"Heat Metal: Reapply Damage\">Reapply Heat Metal</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Cause a metal <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapon</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Armour\" title=\"Armour\">Armour</a> to glow red-hot and force the creature touching it to let go or receive <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/34px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/52px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/34px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"34\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>. If the creature is only wearing metal armour, it always receives Disadvantage. \n\nIf the creature is still touching the metal, you can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> on subsequent turns to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Heat_Metal\" title=\"Reapply Heat Metal\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/38px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/50px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reapply Heat Metal\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp/25px-Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Heat_Metal_Reapply_Damage_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reapply_Heat_Metal\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reapply Heat Metal\">Reapply Heat Metal</a> to deal another <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">2d8</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage and force the creature to let go or receive Disadvantage. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715143732\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1159/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24549/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5113/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1161609/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   48.945      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   48.945      1 -total\n 34.89%   17.078      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 14.25%    6.977      3 Template:Template_style\n 14.12%    6.910      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 10.38%    5.083     12 Template:Trim\n 10.28%    5.030      1 Template:Spell_action/format\n  9.02%    4.413      2 Template:Icon_text\n  8.48%    4.151      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.84%    3.838      1 Template:Uid_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pc